{
  "bookId": "hero-214016",
  "id": "bond-26047",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26047001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "手办屋？这未免也太大了......\n完全是超大号行李箱的尺寸。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26047002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "反正以玉夏的实力，这点空间很快就会被各种周边填满。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26047003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "笨蛋，才没那么夸张！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26047004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "况且，玉夏不希望其他人知道自己的兴趣。\n有自己的储物空间会安全一些。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26047005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "避开别人的眼光吗？\n那种事情，现在已经无所谓了......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26047006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "有你能接受真实的我，就足够了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26047007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "足够了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26047008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "当然，至于原因......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26047009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "呐，这次不是台词哦，是正式的、认真的告白：",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26047010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "你是我最在意的人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
